    <title>Special Weather Statement issued August 7 at 12:46PM CDT by NWS Norman OK</title>
    <summary>At 1246 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 7
miles northwest of Perkins, moving east at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts of 40 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

Locations impacted include...
Perkins.</summary>
